{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0503_1000_p", "source_sha256": "28546abd68a2de823f08b64dc5e345987a043e8e6ac215cce690ae42ea4d8f9f", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影が終わった。\n風花は調子がよかったのか、終始スムーズだった）", "zh": "（照片杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄结束了。\n风花可能状态不错，从头到尾都进行得很顺利）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0503_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "badd5afcac3d236b18d2fdca09c3a5642247b0ac99c9c6a7de5c244d4db65625", "ja": "うふふっ♪　はぁ～……。\nやっぱりいいな～、このパジャマ♪", "zh": "呵呵呵♪　哈～……。\n这套睡衣果然很舒服呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0503_1002_p", "source_sha256": "570d5a50853fc9d71f346c73073b5c27b65cb83dc2838a9964e72ac1748e034e", "ja": "お疲れさま、風花。カメラマンさんが\nいい表情をしてたって、褒めてたよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，风花。摄影师夸你说，刚才的表情很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0503_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "de60b06cc205317892fee9e62e2463a420720af7f44e72f52046ed3467449a5f", "ja": "本当ですか！？　よかったぁ……。\nきっと、このパジャマのおかげですね♪", "zh": "真的吗！？太好了……一定是多亏了这套睡衣呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0503_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b848c492d2f622ee38b3ee04a5386449c412551ada13425204f9dbc27af735f9", "ja": "ふわふわしてて……日向ぼっこしながら\nネコちゃんと遊んでいるような感じがするんです。", "zh": "感觉软绵绵的……就像一边晒着太阳，一边和小猫咪玩耍一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0503_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e6d0a43432ad2e58159518d4ce7700d1c8b67ce29ad8f138c346842a8f202457", "ja": "だから、つい顔が緩んじゃって……。", "zh": "所以，不知不觉就露出了笑容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0503_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a260d971cfd50874060c6732c16c8973151953337091d23452b358668ed694a0", "ja": "ははっ、いいじゃないか。\nそれだけ、心地いい手触りだってことだろ？", "zh": "哈哈，这不是挺好的吗？\n这就说明手感舒服到让人爱不释手吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0503_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2f8546a97993033dcab1c521cc40c22d07c54d56d92f144f42d40db51b984d60", "ja": "はい。時間を忘れて、\nずーっと触ってたいなって思うくらい。ふふ♪", "zh": "是的。舒服到让人想忘记时间，一直摸下去呢。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0503_1008_p", "source_sha256": "309e201a9d9f9dcede1b481364403c35e9a670ecd7127b802bd0c98adb975915", "ja": "そんなに……？　風花がそう言うと、\nどんな手触りか気になってくるな……。", "zh": "有那么……？风花一这么说，我也开始好奇到底是什么手感了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0503_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "cc3fa721c5bdebbb5122d5d283da7f89d2374743175b9b66ba738f118c1227ee", "ja": "それなら、触っていいと思いますよ。相手のことを\n思って、優しく撫でたら、大丈夫だと思います！", "zh": "这样的话，应该可以摸吧。只要想着对方，温柔地抚摸，我觉得就没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0503_1010_p", "source_sha256": "726eba1e2d426a9c0aab99f9c9344722fd27e31518f101b12f1fedf6e8250073", "ja": "えっ！？　そ、そうなのか……？", "zh": "诶！？是、是这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0503_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "758d35aa7dff4d59d84ae66b493aa117307ba18136de51003c8be944a87e4c23", "ja": "はい。あと、触る場所には注意してくださいね！\n変なところだと、驚いて怒っちゃいますから。", "zh": "是的。另外，请注意要触摸的地方哦！  \n要是碰到奇怪的地方，它会吓一跳然后生气的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0503_1012_p", "source_sha256": "35377c3ef83b6c6aa31ddf32895cd06fc008cdf1586f3b5a09322e8852b21e5d", "ja": "いや、そこは普通に気をつけると思うけど……\nやっぱり、触るわけには……！", "zh": "不，那个我肯定会正常注意的……\n但还是不能摸……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0503_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8632870fbc257fabb0143122d883ec98ec75ac969370a4e744caecd470b8ef73", "ja": "えっ？　でも{$P$}さんも\n触ってみたいですよね？　……ふわふわのネコちゃん♪", "zh": "诶？不过{$P$}先生也想摸摸看吧？……软绵绵的小猫咪♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0503_1014_p", "source_sha256": "1c9f3c6b8e33a5eb2a1fe00b4e0ebd89cbf64177205ee16a2176b4ceabf4698b", "ja": "えっ、ネコ？　そ、そっか……。\nてっきり、パジャマを触るのかと……。", "zh": "诶，猫？这、这样啊……\n我还以为是要摸睡衣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0503_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "31ba7748cd82e6d95e0b9b9835b8b9e0eb0f5964bbc47e098e1b2f7261e33449", "ja": "パジャマって……えっ？\nあれ？　それじゃ、今の話～……！？", "zh": "睡衣……诶？\n咦？那也就是说，刚才说的是～……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0503_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "627a596c27b205ab18e40afe944ce0cc5ffc4a10f437dea86df71b7c083016b7", "ja": "違うんです！　私、そういうつもりじゃなくて！\nす、すみません……私、着替えに行ってきます……！", "zh": "不是的！我不是那个意思！对、对不起……我这就去换衣服……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
